	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepimus tuas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief <ref target="file12829">Nr. 2780</ref> vom 30. Januar, der dem Ratsboten <persName ref="p7193">Hans Zingg</persName> anvertraut wurde; s. <ref target="file12837">Nr. 2788</ref>, Anm. 16.</note> una cum amplissimi senatus <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>literis ad nos<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nämlich den <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Pfarrern in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName>: <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName>, <persName ref="p8130">Lorenz Meyer (Agricola)</persName>. <persName ref="p2812">(Hans) Thoman Ruman (Römer)</persName> und <persName ref="p6544">Rudolf Schwyzer d.Ä.</persName></note> et ad senatum <placeName ref="l18">Augustanum</placeName> missis.<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zu diesen Briefen vom 30. Januar s. die oben in Anm. 1 angeführte Stelle.</note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scribunt, ut nos, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>si non possint<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Subjekt sind die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Behörden.</note> liberam <pb type="edition" next="289"/> nobis condicere tuitionem, remittant; si vero <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>hoc possint, ipsorum arbitrio permiserunt aut retinere nos aut dim<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ittere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2812">Romanus</persName> et ego, quandoquidem aperte non sumus revocati, ipsis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>splendida nobis promittentibus<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <ref target="file12835">Nr. 2786</ref>,19-37. 42-44.</note> non vidimus occasionem abeundi hon<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>estam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Si enim nos discederemus, non dubito, quin <placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> magnifice (quid nobis promiserunt)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note> scripturi essent; unde <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>magna nobis apud vos conflaretur invidia.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Weil <persName ref="p8130">Meyer</persName> und <persName ref="p6544">Schwyzer</persName> auf solch ein gutes Zeugnis neidisch wären und die <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> gegen die beiden anderen Pfarrer aufhetzen würden.</note></s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Statuimus ergo maiorem expectare <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>occasionem, qua uti volumus, si se obtulerit, nemine consulto, nisi d. <persName ref="p8354">Laeto</persName>.<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName>. -Dies bedeutet also, dass der <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rat in dessen Brief an die Pfarrer <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> und <persName ref="p2812">Ruman</persName> in Bezug auf den Entscheid, ob <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> zu verlassen sei oder nicht, die Erlaubnis gab, sich im Notfall an der Meinung von <persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> (und nicht an der des ganzen <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Rats) zu orientieren. Dies entsprach z.T. dem von <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> in Nr. 2786,47-56, geäußerten Wunsch.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p8130">Laurentius</persName> et <persName ref="p6544">Rodolphus</persName> antiquum obtinent et tam importuna effutiunt, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ut etiam non dubito, quin, si maxime manere vellent, essent remittendi.<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. schon <ref target="file12835">Nr. 2786</ref>,57-61; <ref target="file12840">Nr. 2791</ref>,66- 70; <ref target="file12852">Nr. 2803</ref>,8-10.</note></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Ablegabuntur brevi.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2812">Romanum</persName> et me dimittere omnino nolunt<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Subjekt sind die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Behörden.</note>, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vel imminentia urgeant pericula vel aperta a <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> fiat vocatio.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Nihil ergo nobis consultum est hoc dominorum<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName>.</note> consilio, nisi quod vident <placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nos dominis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> curae esse.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p6544">Svitzerus</persName>, homo superbus et contumax, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>se mihi valde opposuit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Rogo, ab eius me defendas calumniis; <persName ref="p8130">Lau<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>rentius</persName> ut magis doctus ita etiam magis modestus.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <bibl source="b21">HBBW XVIII</bibl> 306,53.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Conquestus sum ego <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>apud consules<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p3927">Hans Welser</persName> und <persName ref="p1410">Jakob Herbrot</persName>.</note> magnam nobis<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> und <persName ref="p2812">Ruman</persName>.</note> invidiam et calumniam ex eis orituram <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>reversis, si nos maneamus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Responderunt, ut diligenter disquiram <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et, sicubi sentiam eos maligne nobis obloqui, eos tali<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Darauf folgt in der Vorlage</hi> eos.</note> velle prosequi <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>elogio, ut vellent<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Subjekt sind <persName ref="p8130">Meyer</persName> und <persName ref="p6544">Schwyzer</persName>.</note> se fuisse modestiores.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tu igitur nos defendas, nam ha<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>bebimus alias universum senatum<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Augustanum.</note>, qui nos defendat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Interim tamen, cum pericula <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>minora non sint, proditiones, seditiones intestinae metuendae,<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. <ref target="file12793">Nr. 2744</ref>,18; <ref target="file12818">Nr. 2769</ref>,15; <ref target="file12840">Nr. 2791</ref>,76f.</note> adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>rogo, ut alio modo consulas.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Promittunt illi<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Ratsherren.</note>; sed, cum maxime, ut praestarent, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>opus erit, non poterunt.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Nullum tamen detrectabo subire periculum, quod ad Christi <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>cedat gloriam.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ea vero, quae <pb type="edition" next="290"/> nec gloriosa Christo, nec ecclesiae utilia, nec nobis<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Die Lesung</hi> vobis <hi>wäre auch möglich.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>salutifera, fugere debet christianus omnis.<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Vgl. dazu <ref target="file12840">Nr. 2791</ref>,72-79.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p7242">Claudio <span type="pronoun">illo</span> Sabaudo</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p7242">Claude d'Aliod</persName>; s. <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Mitteilungen in <ref target="file12808">Nr. 2759</ref>,93-103, und <ref target="file12835">Nr. 2786</ref>,81f.</note> scripsi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>dudum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dixit mihi tabellio ille <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinus</placeName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Zu dessen Namen s. oben Anm. 1.</note> uxorem eius<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Unbekannt.</note> diu <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> fuisse <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>commoratam.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Seminavit Arianam haeresim nec paucos (qui et cum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ipso incarcerati sunt) infecit.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Tandem revocavit cum suis complicibus cor<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>am senatu.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Scriptam etiam post se relinquens recantationem<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Es könnte sich dabei um die im <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> "Strafbuch" unter dem 2. Februar 1547 aufgezeichnete Widerrufung <persName ref="p7242">d'Aliods</persName> handeln, die in <hi>Roth. Augsburg</hi> III 271f, Anm. 46, abgedruckt ist.</note> dimissus est.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p3590">Langrafium</persName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> venationi incumbere aiunt, et plurimi suspicantur omnis illius <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>tragoediae, quam gener eius <persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName><note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="24">Herzog <persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName> war mit <persName ref="p3590">Philipps</persName> Tochter <persName ref="p18825">Agnes</persName> verheiratet.</note> movit, fuisse conscium.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Ego <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>tamen non credo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Caesareanos milites in urbe nullos adhuc habemus,<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Vgl. nämlich <ref target="file12840">Nr. 2791</ref>,80f.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>nisi qui peregrinantes transeunt.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Speramus <persName ref="p18538">caesarem</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> ita occupatum futurum, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ut nos ipsis non sit gravaturus.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">O utinam!</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Caeterum de his <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>d. <persName ref="p8354">Laetus</persName> et verius et copiosius,<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27">Mit dessen Brief <ref target="file12852">Nr. 2803</ref> vom 8. Februar, in dem <persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> sich allerdings nicht darüber äußerte.</note> quem ego unum suspicio.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div9" corresp="regest9">
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Saluta fratres et familiam.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat vos <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName><note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28"><persName ref="p8417">Wolfgang Musculus</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p1860">Cellarius</persName><note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29"><persName ref="p1860">Michael Keller</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p8173">X<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ystus</persName>.<note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" n="30"><persName ref="p8173">Sixt Birck</persName>.</note></s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Hodie a <persName ref="p3018">Stanggaro</persName><note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31"><persName ref="p3018">Francesco Stancaro</persName>. - Zu dessen Weggang aus <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> s. <ref target="file12802">Nr. 2753</ref>,24f; <ref target="file12835">Nr. 2786</ref>, Anm. 14.</note> literas accepimus, qui <placeName ref="l28">Basilaeam</placeName> pervenit.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p2916">Schertlium</persName> modo vobiscum esse aut fuisse credo.<note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32">Vgl. schon <ref target="file12835">Nr. 2786</ref>,7f. - <persName ref="p2916">Schertlin</persName> war am 2. Februar in <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> angekommen (s. <ref target="file12818">Nr. 2769</ref>, Anm. 18), sollte sich aber nicht in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> niederlassen; s. <ref target="file12849">Nr. 2800</ref>, Anm. 22.</note></s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Dedi enim ei, id a me <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>exigenti, commendatitias ad <persName ref="p1888">consulem Lafaterum</persName>.<note xml:id="fn33" type="footnote" n="33"><persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note></s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Vir vere magnus est <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>et dignus, qui ab omnibus bonis ametur.<note xml:id="fn34" type="footnote" n="34">Diese Bemerkung über <persName ref="p2916">Schertlin</persName> hat <persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> wohl deshalb hinzugefügt, um seine in <ref target="file12793">Nr. 2744</ref>,51f, geäußerte Enttäuschung wieder gutzumachen.</note></s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale denuo.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">9. februarii 1547.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p8018">I. Hallerus</persName> perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. m. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino et patri s<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>uo venerando.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>